THIRD-PARTY DATA
This repository does not redistribute source single-cell datasets.
Tabula Sapiens (cellxgene, CC-BY-4.0), SEA-AD (Allen Brain Cell Atlas,
CC BY-NC 4.0 plus Allen Institute Terms of Use and citation policy), and
ROSMAP (AD Knowledge Portal, controlled access) retain their original
terms. SEA-AD-derived artifacts may be shared only non-commercially with
Allen attribution; controlled-access ROSMAP data are represented here by
manifests and donor identifiers only. Per-artifact decisions live in
spec/redistribution_manifest.json.

MODEL WEIGHTS
Trained checkpoints released through the project channels carry a
provenance manifest identifying their training-data license chain.
Weights trained on Tabula Sapiens blood are Apache-2.0; weights trained
on SEA-AD may be released only under CC BY-NC 4.0 (non-commercial);
weights derived from controlled-access data (ROSMAP) are never
released. Third-party model weights are never re-hosted — the original
repositories and versions are cited instead.
